   Free icon (feather-pointed) rasterized into the package logo PNG:
   Font Awesome Free 6.5.2, icons CC BY 4.0 / fonts SIL OFL 1.1 / code MIT,
   copyright 2024 Fonticons, Inc. See tractoverse/inst/brand/NOTICE for the
   full provenance record.

4. freesurferformats (inspiration, NOT bundled)
   ---------------------------------------------
   riot's MRtrix (.tck/.tsf) and TrackVis (.trk) readers were inspired by
   Tim Schäfer's 'freesurferformats' R package (CRAN, MIT
   https://github.com/dfsp-spirit/freesurferformats). No source code is
